WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:42.170
[This film will not be shown to the general
public without permission of the War Department.]

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:43.170
[War Department official training film. T.F.
8 2093 Army Service Forces]

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.170
[Produced by Army Pictorial Service Signal
Corps]

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.170
[Strictly Personal]

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.170
I'll bet she passed her physical with honors.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:47.170
The Venus of Cyrene, approximately 400 B.C.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:55.530
If the Greeks had a word for her, it certainly
would mean, "in perfect physical shape."

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.719
In perfect physical shape; yes that's what
it takes to do the man-sized job you've picked

00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:05.479
for yourselves when you volunteered.

00:01:05.479 --> 00:01:10.979
And that means more than just passing your
enlistment physical.

00:01:10.979 --> 00:01:15.450
It means far more than gaining immunity from
contagious diseases through inoculations and

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:17.460
yearly booster shots.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:23.170
Yes, and far more than getting a clean bill
of health at those monthly checkups.

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:27.369
Those things you can take for granted as part
of Army Medical Corps vigilance to protect

00:01:27.369 --> 00:01:28.799
your health,

00:01:28.799 --> 00:01:33.640
for your sickness might well undermine the
health of the entire group.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:37.520
"Open up."

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:42.700
Report to sick call whenever you feel below
par, but be reasonable. Don't go running to

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:48.540
your medical officer for imaginary ailments.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:53.189
There's a world of difference between indulging
yourself, and being good to yourself.

00:01:53.189 --> 00:02:01.870
A world of difference between not being sick,
and feeling glowingly healthy.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:04.409
Especially when you're doing a job in the
Army.

00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:08.360
It's all the difference between dragging along
in a negative half-hearted way because your

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:11.600
vitality is low,

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:16.640
and living and working dynamically in a state
of positive well-being because you have a

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:21.170
reserve of energy to fall back on.

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:25.220
To help you achieve this, we are calling upon
a woman who has devoted her life to teaching

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:28.680
women the principles and technique of body
harmony

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:35.180
which increases one's effectiveness and attractiveness
in every department of living: Miss Helen

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.180
Matthews.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:43.290
"This is the ideal average figure of the modern
American woman. And note I said average.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:48.900
Did I hear someone say figures like that don't
exist outside Hollywood and the art galleries?

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:49.989
But they do.

00:02:49.989 --> 00:02:56.780
The physical proportions of this lovely body
[unintelligible] Neck, bust, waist, hip, arm,

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:04.580
leg measurements are [unintelligible] average
American women ages 16 to 40.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:09.210
And you'll be even more astonished when I
tell you they correspond closely to hers.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:14.590
Now I'm not saying that each of you can make
yourself over in 10 easy lessons to look like

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:19.590
the Venus of Cyrene, but I am saying that
you modern women have an advantage over this

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:23.370
classic beauty--you have a head.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:29.530
If you use it and your muscles and a little
self-discipline you'll be surprised how much

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:35.939
you personally can do to make yourself look
better and work better and longer with less

00:03:35.939 --> 00:03:40.549
fatigue because you feel better.

00:03:40.549 --> 00:03:46.750
There's no mystery to it. Feeling better simmers
down to following a few simple rules:

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:53.600
[Nutrition] It means paying more attention
to nutrition.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:04:00.910
[Exercise] It means understanding and putting
heart into planned exercise.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:09.650
[Rest] It means getting sufficient and proper
rest. Primarily rest means sleep, sound sleep,

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:15.040
health sleep, beauty sleep, which get your
body and mind a chance to recover from today's

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.470
activities in order to prepare for tomorrow's.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.663
"Did I forget to lock the files? Why hasn't
Jim written? The Colonel's going to want the

00:04:19.663 --> 00:04:23.120
paper tomorrow. It won't be finished. Why
can't I go to sleep?"

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:43.200
"You are all tied up in knots. Don't fight
so hard. Let go. Start with your arms and

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:52.120
legs. Let your whole body to limp gradually."

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:58.510
You can't expect to sleep until you relax.
Watch this silly little kitten.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:03.890
She could give us all some valuable pointers
on the technique of relaxation. She knows

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:09.120
how to relax naturally. But we may have to
work for it.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:13.120
Relaxing completely like this will help you
to go to sleep. It will also work wonders

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.919
in renewing your daytime energy if you can
find a few moments for it at midday.

00:05:17.919 --> 00:05:21.060
But there are other ways to renew your energy
on the job.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:30.360
She's trying too hard and getting nowhere
fast. Oh my, she spoiled another sheet. In

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:59.789
a case like this pause from your work for
a moment, relax that tension.

00:05:59.789 --> 00:06:05.300
In the case of the worker who uses her brawn,
a change to less vigorous refresher activity

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.970
will do the trick.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:12.800
In other words, slow down instead of letting
down all at once. Learn how to save your energy

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.030
by conserving your movements.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:21.560
Restore your energy through sleep. Renew it
through relaxation. Save it by conserving

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.060
your movements.

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:28.229
One of the best ways, though, to prevent fatigue
is to build strength within your own body

00:06:28.229 --> 00:06:32.870
and to master the knack of doing things, called
body mechanics.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.469
And you can only do that through exercise.

00:06:34.469 --> 00:06:40.440
When I speak of exercise I don't mean any
kind of exercise, I mean planned exercise.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:42.760
The kind that really produces results.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:50.740
It isn't easy. It's often tiresome. It wears
off those bulges and bumps; it put your weight

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:57.900
in the right places; it gives you an active,
supple and shapely body.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:03.690
Foundation garments have their place. But
the best foundation garment in the world is

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:09.470
right inside your own body--your muscles.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:16.010
Any foundation garment wears out with use.
But your muscles do just the opposite. They

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.979
gain snap and elasticity the more they are
used.

00:07:18.979 --> 00:07:27.130
Proper exercise will save you the embarrassment
of being called one of those attractive from

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:31.840
the neck up girls. And I don't mean the intellectual
type.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:40.110
Consistent, daily, planned exercise can be
all things to all people.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:45.020
It can put inches on a thin girl and fill
her out.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:49.969
It can take inches off the fat girl and slim
her down.

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:56.669
It can re-proportion the girl with the un-symmetrical
figure so that her curves fall in the right

00:07:56.669 --> 00:07:58.740
places.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:05.370
Planned exercise can also aid the internal
mechanism of the body by aiding in the prevention

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:08.600
of constipation and menstrual distress.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:13.940
But it can't accomplish these miracles alone,
which brings me around to nutrition - perhaps

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:19.539
the most important of the factors could keep
you in perfect physical shape.

00:08:19.539 --> 00:08:24.719
Your army meals are carefully planned by expert
dietitians and contain all the food elements

00:08:24.719 --> 00:08:28.300
necessary for a well-balanced diet.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:33.050
Take a look at this tray: there's protein
for muscle building in the hamburger, although

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.281
you get it from eggs and cheese as well as
meat.

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:41.089
There is starch for energy in the potatoes
and bread. The sugar in the Fig Newton gives

00:08:41.089 --> 00:08:43.310
you more energy.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:49.300
Minerals and water in the vegetables, fruit
and milk nourish blood and bones.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:54.140
As for those alphabetical vitamins which are
essential for the prevention of disease, they

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:59.440
are generously represented in all Army menus.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:04.209
Before we take it away, let's take one more
look at the tray. It's both what you eat and

00:09:04.209 --> 00:09:10.050
how much that counts. And that brings us to
the burning question of calories.

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:17.800
A body is similar to a machine. It runs on
fuel called calories. A calorie is a familiar

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:22.690
and convenient name for the unit by which
we the measure fuel value of the food we consume.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:29.060
In everything we do, these calories are used.
Calories which are not used for activity are

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:32.060
stored in the body is fat.

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:36.240
Your weight depends on the balance between
the calories you take in, and the calories

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:39.660
you need for your daily activities.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:48.889
If you consume more calories than you need,
you gain weight.

00:09:48.889 --> 00:09:59.629
If you take in fewer calories than you need,
you lose weight

00:09:59.629 --> 00:10:09.339
If there is a perfect balance between calorie
intake and calorie need, your weight remains

00:10:09.339 --> 00:10:17.230
constant.

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:28.380
Surprised? Now you see how important it is
to know the calorie count of the foods you

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:32.759
eat.

00:10:32.759 --> 00:10:43.379
But you don't have to skimp at meals. Just
cut out those between meal sweets. Next time,

00:10:43.379 --> 00:10:48.089
try fruit or fruit juices instead of that
chock malt.

00:10:48.089 --> 00:10:53.649
Tsk, tsk. Think of your weight!

00:10:53.649 --> 00:11:07.860
[Your Fortune--You have a broad outlook, a
wide base for your activities. Though life

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:24.110
may put a strain on you in the near future,
there's a bright horizon just beyond.]

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:29.160
Don't be misguided. Your age should not influence
your weight very much but the size of your

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.649
frame does.

00:11:30.649 --> 00:11:34.000
Here is the correct calculation.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:53.399
Pardon this note of gloom, but stout people
are more likely to develop chronic diseases

00:11:53.399 --> 00:11:54.880
than thin people.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:12:05.399
This is due to the extra burden on their vital
organs.

00:12:05.399 --> 00:12:10.470
Not being able to make the grade is an extreme
example of what happens to people who avoid

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:14.189
proper rest, daily exercise, wholesome diet.

00:12:14.189 --> 00:12:20.829
But there's another more usual result of ignoring
the ABCs of a sensible health regime.

00:12:20.829 --> 00:12:27.230
It's a condition common among GIs. It often
appears very funny to the other fellow, but

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:36.610
never to its victim.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:41.240
"This thing has certainly got her worried."

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:44.149
"No results in three days; that's serious
isn't it?"

00:12:44.149 --> 00:12:48.240
"Well not according to what the medical officer
told me. It doesn't have to be a once a day

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.779
habit but it does have to be a habit.

00:12:50.779 --> 00:12:54.459
She goes at all hours of the day and night
but never two days in succession at the same

00:12:54.459 --> 00:12:55.459
time."

00:12:55.459 --> 00:12:59.290
"She swallowed half of that bottle in less
than a week."

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.699
"How you doing?"

00:13:01.699 --> 00:13:05.709
"Hey what's the big idea?"

00:13:05.709 --> 00:13:12.110
"Here try this. It will do you more good."

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:14.670
"Since when do you consider yourself a health
authority?"

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:19.309
"Since I stopped concentrating on patent medicines
and started concentrating on coming here at

00:13:19.309 --> 00:13:23.319
regular time each day and when I have more
than a couple of seconds.

00:13:23.319 --> 00:13:27.759
I'm just passing on what the medical officer
told me. Cut out all the junk you eat and

00:13:27.759 --> 00:13:31.100
go in for fresh vegetables and fruits and
drink lots of water."

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:40.290
"Come on now. Since you tried everything else
you might just as well try the easy way."

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:51.000
"Hey come on, get going. You've got exactly
5 minutes before drill."

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.980
"I can't drill today I'm unwell."

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.319
"Come on get up and take a shower you'll be
all right."

00:13:55.319 --> 00:14:00.959
"A shower? Are you insane? It's almost suicide
at this time of the month."

00:14:00.959 --> 00:14:07.980
A 20th-century girl still clinging to that
lavender and old lace hokum about no activity,

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:11.680
no bathing during menstruation. That's Victorian
stuff.

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:16.839
And so is the hush-hush about nerves and sensibilities
during this period.

00:14:16.839 --> 00:14:21.550
Women are where they are today, and you are
where you are today, because women have learned

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:24.129
to take it in their stride.

00:14:24.129 --> 00:14:28.699
And there are other silly superstitions concerning
this perfectly normal function of the female

00:14:28.699 --> 00:14:34.330
body. They are as out of place in modern life
as the spinning wheel of the [coting for].

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:40.050
But when I tell some women that menstruation
is no excuse for absenteeism and self coddling,

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:46.779
they look quite hurt and bewildered, and start
bombarding me with all sorts of questions.

00:14:46.779 --> 00:14:50.329
"What if you have the cramps and have to go
to bed?"

00:14:50.329 --> 00:14:53.709
"Isn't something wrong if if your period doesn't
come every 28 days?"

00:14:53.709 --> 00:14:56.990
"Is it abnormal if the amount of flow is always
changing?"

00:14:56.990 --> 00:15:01.170
"Are we expected to suffer and still go about
our business as usual when we have the curse?"

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.319
"What are the best hygienic protections?"

00:15:03.319 --> 00:15:06.040
"How do you know when you're starting your
menopause?"

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:10.980
"Do the nerves always go to pieces during
the menopause?"

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:17.619
Let's clear the fog once and for all by letting
one of your own medical officers answer these

00:15:17.619 --> 00:15:20.330
questions, but one at a time.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:26.980
First I want to say that there is no need
to consider menstruation a curse. It's just

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:31.470
nature's way of ridding your body of its preparation
for pregnancy.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:36.760
This whole process should take place as painlessly
and as easily as digestion.

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:41.970
The fact that it doesn't with some of you
may be due to a variety of reasons. And that

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.809
brings me to that question about cramps.

00:15:44.809 --> 00:15:51.949
If you'll notice the position of the uterus
between the rectum and the bladder you will

00:15:51.949 --> 00:15:56.690
realize that pressure on it from constipation
will cause cramps and a heavy feeling in the

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:59.850
abdomen.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:05.619
So will slack abdominal muscles. Good ways
to relieve this feeling are physical activity

00:16:05.619 --> 00:16:14.329
and application of heat. They both stimulate
circulation of blood and relax the muscles.

00:16:14.329 --> 00:16:19.110
There is as much difference within your body
when your posture is good or poor, as there

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:28.769
is between these two piles of blocks.

00:16:28.769 --> 00:16:34.290
When you stand and sit incorrectly your abdominal
organs are so crowded that they have no room

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:36.649
to function efficiently.

00:16:36.649 --> 00:16:41.740
But when you stand and sit correctly they
assume their proper place and don't interfere

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:44.389
with your natural functions.

00:16:44.389 --> 00:16:50.010
if your posture is good and your abdominal
muscles firm, you'll suffer less pain during

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:51.230
menstruation.

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:56.899
Now as to your question, "Is there something
wrong if your menstrual periods don't come

00:16:56.899 --> 00:16:59.259
every 28 days?"

00:16:59.259 --> 00:17:05.370
The normal menstrual period can easily vary
between 22 and 40 days, although the usual

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.130
time is 28 days.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:12.709
The duration of the flow usually lasts from
four to five days, but there is no need for

00:17:12.709 --> 00:17:16.280
alarm if it lasts only two days or as long
as eight days.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:20.209
These variations depend on the individual.

00:17:20.209 --> 00:17:25.480
The amount of flow also varies with the individual.
With some women it's only scant staining of

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.230
a few pads for the entire period.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:33.420
For others it's saturation from six to eight
pads a day, but profuse flow most generally

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:35.990
takes place the first and second days.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:41.460
A radical change of climate can bring about
irregularity in the menses. Women who move

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:45.170
from tropical to winter climates find that
they may start skipping periods until they

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:47.080
adjust themselves to the new environment.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:54.060
And again, changes in habits will also cause
a great change in the amount of flow.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:57.690
This girl would stop worrying if she knew
that her flow had increased some because she

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:02.170
changed from a sedentary to a physically active
job.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:08.790
So you see there are many causes for irregularities
in the menses beside the obvious ones of pregnancy

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.040
and menopause.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:16.790
If your periods are irregular, it's a good
thing to go to the medical officer.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:24.130
The choice between the external pad and the
tampon is a purely personal one, and depends

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:30.320
largely on what you find is a safer and more
convenient protection for you.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:37.130
The tampon fits into the vagina in this fashion,
but a tampon will be uncomfortable and irritating

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:41.440
if the vagina is small or the menstrual flow
heavy.

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:46.680
In these cases the external pad is far more
satisfactory.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:51.591
Since the chance of body odors is greater
at this time if you use sanitary pads, change

00:18:51.591 --> 00:18:58.820
them often, and take frequent baths and use
deodorants.

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:01.980
And it isn't necessary to douche after your
period or at any other time unless you've

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:05.270
been advised to do so by your doctor.

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:09.230
Artificial cleansing tends to destroy the
body fluids that take care of this cleansing

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.840
process naturally.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:15.080
"How do you know when you're starting your
menopause?"

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:21.010
The symptoms are much the same as those of
adolescence: nervousness, menstrual irregularity,

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:24.210
circulatory disturbances and unbalanced glands.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:29.950
But adolescence seems a wonderful period as
we look back, doesn't it?

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:35.890
So there is no reason why life still can't
begin at 40. And it often does.

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:39.880
I think many women would lose their fear of
menopause if once they realize that menopause

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:45.881
means only the end of their childbearing life,
and not the end of their sexual life, their

00:19:45.881 --> 00:19:49.880
attractiveness or their usefulness.

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.690
"Forward march!"

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:56.821
So you see there's no reason to get excited
about normal female functions. They are just

00:19:56.821 --> 00:20:01.880
a part of your life. You can always take them
in your stride.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:07.240
There is one more thought I want to leave
with you on this subject.

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:13.080
Remarkable progress has been made in new therapeutic
treatments for the physical and psychological

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:17.190
disorders that occasionally accompany menopause.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:22.280
Today no woman need ever again fear this period
in her life.

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:28.360
There is one common ailment which you shouldn't
take in your stride. If you do, your coworkers

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:34.300
have every right to consider you public enemy
number one.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:40.820
[sneeze] This lady is spreading millions of
cold germs and exposing all these young trainees

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:44.520
and the instructor to possible cold infection.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:55.830
[cough cough] "You'd better go on sick call.
Now don't give me that routine about 'not

00:20:55.830 --> 00:21:03.990
sick enough,' or 'no time.' Do you want to
put all of us in the hospital with pneumonia?

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:04.990
"

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:08.160
Perhaps many of you consider these things
too obvious for discussion, but there are

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:12.440
still women in both army and civilian circles
who don't know what symptoms of physical distress

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:14.300
to take seriously, or vice versa.

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:21.460
There are also those who moan and groan about
vague aches and pains that they can't localize.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:26.450
One of the causes of their mysterious suffering
that seems to evade their diagnosis, but at

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:34.400
the same time to invade every fiber of their
bodies, is unhappy feet.

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:40.030
Unhappy feet can make a pessimist out of an
optimist overnight.

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:44.530
If you don't like to suffer, see that your
shoes are properly fitted. Trust the judgment

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:52.280
of the fitter as to size. She knows much more
about your feet in the Army than you do.

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:56.820
And that applies both to your dress shoes
and your little Abner's. Be sure to wear wool

00:21:56.820 --> 00:22:01.340
socks with these little Abner's.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:05.890
Don't wear the same pair of shoes each day.
Change off until they're broken in and feel

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:14.130
comfortable. A change eases your feet even
after your shoes are broken in.

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:16.810
That means foot trouble!

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:20.260
And so does this.

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:25.550
First sterilize a needle with a lighted match.

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:38.250
Then prick the blister at the lower end.

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:46.690
Just open enough to empty fluid from the blister.
Don't remove the skin.

00:22:46.690 --> 00:22:50.710
Then cover the blister with a good sized strip
of zinc oxide plaster and leave it on for

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:52.020
several days.

00:22:52.020 --> 00:23:01.870
For corns or soft corns, report to your medical
officer immediately, and be sure to report

00:23:01.870 --> 00:23:07.680
also if you think you have that painful fungus
infection: athlete's foot.

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:14.480
Symptoms are cracked skin, painful inflammation
between or below the toes.

00:23:14.480 --> 00:23:18.910
Athlete's foot can spread to others as quickly
as the seven years inch.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:25.240
The germ thrives on warmth and moisture, swimming
pools and latrines.

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:35.820
The first essential of good foot hygiene is
to keep your feet thoroughly dry.

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:43.670
Always dry your feet well and powder between
your toes before putting on stockings.

00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:49.140
And here's another--notice that she's cutting
her nails straight across - not on a curve

00:23:49.140 --> 00:23:51.680
- to prevent ingrown toenails.

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:57.790
Yes, it's most important that you treat your
feet with special consideration and respect,

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:02.250
because now that you are in active service,
you are using them much more than you ever

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:03.260
did before.

00:24:03.260 --> 00:24:08.800
In fact, many of you have to learn how to
walk all over again. Most civilians don't

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:13.150
know how, because they do so little walking.

00:24:13.150 --> 00:24:14.810
Usually they are carried to their destination.

00:24:14.810 --> 00:24:19.890
And when they are not going anywhere in particular,
they stroll or dawdle.

00:24:19.890 --> 00:24:26.890
But in the Army, I hear tell, you have to
depend on your own feet to take you there.

00:24:26.890 --> 00:24:30.510
That's why learning to walk properly is so
important.

00:24:30.510 --> 00:24:37.370
Carry your weight toward the outside border
of the feet. Yes your feet make for good posture.

00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:46.260
Your feet are the base from which you build
your posture.

00:24:46.260 --> 00:24:51.220
Pushing off with your toes and walking from
your hips will give you that 30 inch step

00:24:51.220 --> 00:24:53.260
without any strain.

00:24:53.260 --> 00:25:00.020
For if your knees snap back your hips are
going to protrude. Keep your knees straight,

00:25:00.020 --> 00:25:01.020
but relax

00:25:01.020 --> 00:25:09.280
That's right - toes straight ahead, head up--it's
bound to be if you keep your chest high.

00:25:09.280 --> 00:25:16.380
It may be an optical illusion, but your ankles
do look slimmer when you walk the right way.

00:25:16.380 --> 00:25:21.700
From ankles to smile in one easy jump.

00:25:21.700 --> 00:25:29.910
You can't help noticing teeth when they're
framed in such a smile. That's one very, very

00:25:29.910 --> 00:25:33.490
good reason for keeping them sparkling clean.

00:25:33.490 --> 00:25:39.950
But there are others: Last year the Army Dental
Corps drilled and filled 1,800,000 cavities.

00:25:39.950 --> 00:25:47.190
So you see, tooth trouble is also a common
ailment among GIs.

00:25:47.190 --> 00:25:50.940
"What causes tooth decay?"

00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:57.140
"Oh, a number of things such as poor diet,
not enough vitamins and minerals, too many

00:25:57.140 --> 00:25:58.140
sweets.

00:25:58.140 --> 00:26:02.330
If you eat before going to bed and forget
to brush your teeth afterwards, particles

00:26:02.330 --> 00:26:07.200
of food lodge in the crevices and start to
ferment.

00:26:07.200 --> 00:26:12.430
This encourages bacteria. And bacteria increase
the tendency to tooth decay.

00:26:12.430 --> 00:26:16.530
That's why it's so important to brush your
teeth regularly and even more important to

00:26:16.530 --> 00:26:18.320
brush them correctly,

00:26:18.320 --> 00:26:20.970
from the gums downward, or upward."

00:26:20.970 --> 00:26:37.380
"Uh, uh--not from side to side but up and
down. Yes, that's right - brush from the gum

00:26:37.380 --> 00:26:44.740
downward or upward."

00:26:44.740 --> 00:26:50.760
It does them good just to look at her. Yes,
men are simple creatures--it gives them a

00:26:50.760 --> 00:26:54.620
lift to see a girl looking her most attractive
on the job.

00:26:54.620 --> 00:26:59.800
Vital and freshly wholesome, with that natural
glow that doesn't come in bottles and jars.

00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:03.370
Shining teeth, beautiful skin,

00:27:03.370 --> 00:27:08.090
for which there's nothing like a good scrubbing.

00:27:08.090 --> 00:27:13.500
Although to most of you, it may seem too obvious
to mention, daily bathing is the first must

00:27:13.500 --> 00:27:16.970
in the rulebook for feminine attractiveness.

00:27:16.970 --> 00:27:23.340
The soap you use should be bland, particularly
if your skin has a tendency to be dry.

00:27:23.340 --> 00:27:29.820
Deodorants and perfumes don't kill perspiration
or other body odors. They only make them more

00:27:29.820 --> 00:27:32.440
offensive.

00:27:32.440 --> 00:27:37.870
Since many women are allergic to depilatorys,
shaving is still the most effective way to

00:27:37.870 --> 00:27:41.730
remove superfluous hair.

00:27:41.730 --> 00:27:46.310
If you use a facial cream or oil at night,
be sure to remove the excess grease before

00:27:46.310 --> 00:27:48.920
going to bed.

00:27:48.920 --> 00:27:55.690
For that rosy bloom, a dash of cold water
is the best astringent.

00:27:55.690 --> 00:28:00.770
And for chapped lips, use lip pommade or cream.

00:28:00.770 --> 00:28:07.560
Scalp lifting is in order to stimulate sluggish
circulation, but for oily hair, do it in combination

00:28:07.560 --> 00:28:17.910
with an astringent.

00:28:17.910 --> 00:28:24.450
If you'll pardon the suggestion, a good brushing
might be in order.

00:28:24.450 --> 00:28:33.990
Gently, gently--I didn't say scalping.

00:28:33.990 --> 00:28:39.310
And if you're looking for a change of hairstyling
to suit your facial confirmation and G. I.

00:28:39.310 --> 00:28:57.320
regulations, there is the pageboy,

00:28:57.320 --> 00:29:04.530
the roll,

00:29:04.530 --> 00:29:14.950
the bun,

00:29:14.950 --> 00:29:28.550
the up sweep,

00:29:28.550 --> 00:29:40.460
the straight shingle,

00:29:40.460 --> 00:29:44.430
the curly shingle.

00:29:44.430 --> 00:29:49.750
If you wear your hair short, it should be
cut and shaped often. Snip away the hangovers

00:29:49.750 --> 00:29:52.950
from the last permanent.

00:29:52.950 --> 00:29:57.610
I'm no expert on the problem of makeup.

00:29:57.610 --> 00:30:03.840
Since the proper use of cosmetics is an art
in itself, we'll shift the scene to Hollywood

00:30:03.840 --> 00:30:09.650
and have an authority on beautifying feminine
faces show you how to make the most of your

00:30:09.650 --> 00:30:12.720
face.

00:30:12.720 --> 00:30:21.580
"Never use makeup as a mask. Use it to bring
out, not to hide the natural freshness of

00:30:21.580 --> 00:30:25.630
your skin, and use it conservatively.

00:30:25.630 --> 00:30:31.360
Makeup goes on smoother, looks more natural,
with a foundation cream or liquid.

00:30:31.360 --> 00:30:36.820
It provides a lasting makeup and protects
the skin against wind and sun.

00:30:36.820 --> 00:30:42.770
The wrong use of rouge can make a woman look
hard or clownish.

00:30:42.770 --> 00:30:51.880
Cream rouge is applied directly over the foundation.
Dry rouge is used only after powdering.

00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:58.470
To be effective, rouge and powder should not
be detectable. Never use too much rouge; you

00:30:58.470 --> 00:31:01.370
can always add more, but you can't cover it.

00:31:01.370 --> 00:31:07.990
Application of rouge depends on correct placement.
Cream rouge should be applied with the fingers

00:31:07.990 --> 00:31:15.090
and blended until no line of demarcation is
noticeable.

00:31:15.090 --> 00:31:26.590
Never use an elongated field of rouge on the
oblong face. Always use a circle.

00:31:26.590 --> 00:31:31.570
Never use a circle on the round or square
face. Use an elongated field to create the

00:31:31.570 --> 00:31:33.200
illusion of length.

00:31:33.200 --> 00:31:42.000
When in doubt for placement of rouge, smile
and place it on the highest point of the cheek.

00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:46.950
One should always choose a powder that gives
warmth and brightness to the skin.

00:31:46.950 --> 00:31:54.990
In powdering, start at a receding point such
as under the eyes, outer cheeks or receding

00:31:54.990 --> 00:31:57.400
chin.

00:31:57.400 --> 00:32:06.710
Never powder a large nose first. It will become
a highlight.

00:32:06.710 --> 00:32:12.330
Don't try to improve on nature with one of
those thick Ubangi mouths.

00:32:12.330 --> 00:32:18.420
Follow the natural line of the lips and don't
use exotic lip shades; they are not chic,

00:32:18.420 --> 00:32:34.210
and they are certainly not G.I.

00:32:34.210 --> 00:32:40.200
Bite gently on a piece of tissue to set the
lips and remove excess lipstick.

00:32:40.200 --> 00:32:47.900
Lipstick smears on handkerchiefs and lipstick
rings on cups are not appealing.

00:32:47.900 --> 00:32:51.210
Don't tamper with the natural line of your
eyebrow.

00:32:51.210 --> 00:32:57.220
Your eyebrows as nature made them give expression
and character to your face and are functional.

00:32:57.220 --> 00:33:01.890
They protect your eyes from strong light and
dust.

00:33:01.890 --> 00:33:06.911
These are actually the only articles necessary
for good nail grooming, especially when you're

00:33:06.911 --> 00:33:08.220
in the Army.

00:33:08.220 --> 00:33:15.090
Fu Manchu talons are out when you wear a uniform
and so is exotic nail polish. If you use polish

00:33:15.090 --> 00:33:16.200
see that it is conservative."

00:33:16.200 --> 00:33:29.330
She's learned a lot. See how smoothly and
skillfully her makeup is blended. She can

00:33:29.330 --> 00:33:31.350
be proud of that job.

00:33:31.350 --> 00:33:38.530
And she certainly is proud of her uniform.

00:33:38.530 --> 00:33:43.620
And she keeps it in a condition to reflect
that pride.

00:33:43.620 --> 00:33:51.660
The hang of your uniform depends not only
on the fitting, but on what you have to hang

00:33:51.660 --> 00:33:53.160
it on.

00:33:53.160 --> 00:34:00.760
She's very careful about using dress shields
to avoid perspiration, stains and odors.

00:34:00.760 --> 00:34:07.490
And being fastidious, she never wears her
undies more than once without laundering them

00:34:07.490 --> 00:34:09.119
again.

00:34:09.119 --> 00:34:13.770
She even sees to it that her dog tags are
warm and well-dressed.

00:34:13.770 --> 00:34:29.570
Yes, by keeping yourselves and your belongings
in perfect shape you are showing the world

00:34:29.570 --> 00:34:34.000
and G.I. Joe that you are a mighty sharp looking
lot.

00:34:34.000 --> 00:34:42.410
But more important you are also showing them
that efficiency, endurance, stability and

00:34:42.410 --> 00:34:46.640
courage are by no means exclusively stag affairs.

00:34:46.640 --> 00:34:47.640
[The end. T.F. 8 2093]

00:34:47.640 --> 00:34:47.656
